OL,3,GNEWSAHome Affairs chief criticises
OL,4,AUK-based director
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe president of Guernsey's Home
OL,7,FAffairs Committee has criticised an
OL,8,Farrangement in which the director of
OL,9,Fpopulation management is currently
OL,10,Fbased in the UK.
OL,12,FDeputy Marc Leadbeater said the
OL,13,Fsituation "wasn't a good look".
OL,15,FIt follows criticism of the arrangement
OL,16,Fby the President of the Scrutiny
OL,17,FManagement Committee and former Deputy
OL,18,FChief Minister Mark Helyar.
OL,23,APub: 19-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB Ch Is NewsC  Reg TVF Weather
