OL,3,GNEWSAHome Affairs chief criticises
OL,4,AUK-based director
OL,5,
OL,6,FStates chief executive Boley Smillie
OL,7,Fsaid these kind of arrangements
OL,8,Foccurred only in "exceptional"
OL,9,Fcircumstances and he has committed to a
OL,10,Freview of the States' work-from-home
OL,11,Fpolicy before the end of the year.
